# Git Workflow

## Branch Strategy
- Branches: main, dev, feature/*, hotfix/*
- Prefer non-squash merges to preserve history (unless org policy says otherwise)

## Commit Standards
- Use Conventional Commits for messages
- Generate a tidy changelog on tags
- Never commit generated artefacts or large test data
- Reference buckets/DVC instead

## PR Standards
- Keep PRs focused: one logical change per PR
- Include tests and docs updates
- Provide clear before/after behaviour notes
- Use checklists for risky edits